          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A Tale of Three Intersecting Lines"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.087,
            0.848,
            0.126
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle \\mathrm{XAB} = 50^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle \\mathrm{MAC} = 70^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . Can we find "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle  BAC"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " from this? We know that ∠XAB, ∠YAC and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle  BAC"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " together form "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 8 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . So"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.356,
            0.136,
            0.643,
            0.155
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_19_equation_3.jpg",
          "content": "\\angle XAB + \\angle YAC + \\angle BAC = 180^{\\circ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.379,
            0.171,
            0.619,
            0.192
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_19_equation_4.jpg",
          "content": "50^{\\circ}+\\angle BAC+70^{\\circ}=180^{\\circ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.401,
            0.207,
            0.598,
            0.226
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_19_equation_5.jpg",
          "content": "120^{\\circ}+\\angle BAC=180^{\\circ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.409,
            0.243,
            0.589,
            0.262
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_19_equation_6.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathrm{Thus}, \\angle \\mathrm{BAC} = 60^{\\circ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.267,
            0.848,
            0.305
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now construct a triangle (taking BC to be of any suitable length) and verify if this is indeed the case."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.312,
            0.293,
            0.337
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.345,
            0.85,
            0.384
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Find the third angle of a triangle (using a parallel line) when two of the angles are:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.399,
            0.336,
            0.419
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 6 ^ { \\circ } , 7 2 ^ { \\circ }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
